  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760007,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 180 Sounds: A Darts Challenge for the Commodore 64\n\nStep up to the oche in *180 Sounds*, a fast-paced and engaging darts simulation for the Commodore 64!  Test your skill against a field of virtual opponents in a thrilling championship tournament, adhering to classic darts rules – subtract your score from 501, aiming for a perfect double to finish. \n\nProgress through the competition, starting at the quarter-finals where you’ll face best-of-three matches to advance. Conquer the semi-finals and prepare for the ultimate showdown against the reigning World Champion, \"Jammy Jim.\"  Remarkably, only *one* leg is needed to defeat him and claim victory!\n\nBeyond the tournament, *180 Sounds* offers exciting alternative game modes. Challenge a friend in head-to-head multiplayer or try your hand at \"Round the Clock,\" a frantic race against the clock to hit every number on the dartboard from 20 down to 1.  Can you master the precision and strategy needed to become a darts champion?"
    },
